-- First Tidal Pattern
-- A groovy drum pattern with kick, snare, and hi-hats

d1 $ sound "bd ~ bd ~ bd ~ bd ~"
d2 $ sound "~ ~ sd ~ ~ ~ sd ~"
d3 $ sound "hh*8"

-- Optional: Add some variation and effects
-- Uncomment these lines to try them out:
-- d1 $ sound "bd ~ bd ~ bd ~ bd ~" # gain 1.2
-- d3 $ sound "hh*8" # pan (sine) # speed 1.2

-- To play this:
-- 1. Make sure SuperDirt is running in SuperCollider
-- 2. Boot Tidal in your editor
-- 3. Place cursor on each line and press Shift+Enter (Mac) or Ctrl+Enter (Windows/Linux)
-- 4. You should hear: kick on every beat, snare on beats 3 and 7, hi-hats throughout
